 The other types are coprof $\leq k$, Cohen-Macaulay, $(S_ k)$, regular, $(R_ k)$, and reduced. See <span class="cite">[<span class="postnote">IV Definition 6.8.1.</span>, <a href="/bibliography/EGA">EGA</a>]</span>. Gorenstein morphisms will be defined in Duality for Schemes, Section <a href="/tag/0AWV" data-tag="0AWV">48.24</a>.